<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-page="visual-themes">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="百象悬廊：100 款由 image-2 绘制的视觉符号与艺术配色">
    <title>百象悬廊 · THE HANGING ARCHIVE</title>
    <script src="/js/theme.js?v=6"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css?v=6">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/visual_themes.css?v=4">
</head>
<body class="visual-themes-body" id="top">
    <a class="atlas-skip-link" href="#theme-gallery">跳到主题图鉴</a>

    <header class="atlas-header">
        <nav class="atlas-nav" aria-label="页面导航">
            <a href="/tools" class="atlas-back"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> 返回工具</a>
            <span class="atlas-edition">GUCCANG / HANGING ARCHIVE / 2026</span>
            <a href="/main" class="atlas-home">首页</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="atlas-mobile" aria-hidden="true">
            <i class="mobile-wire"></i>
            <div class="hero-charm hero-charm-one" data-hero-theme="006"></div>
            <div class="hero-charm hero-charm-two" data-hero-theme="025"></div>
            <div class="hero-charm hero-charm-three" data-hero-theme="064"></div>
            <div class="hero-charm hero-charm-four" data-hero-theme="081"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="atlas-hero">
            <div class="atlas-title-block">
                <p class="atlas-kicker">One hundred signs, suspended in color</p>
                <h1><span>百象</span><strong>悬廊</strong></h1>
                <p class="atlas-en-title">THE HANGING ARCHIVE · 001—100</p>
            </div>
            <div class="atlas-intro">
                <p>一百枚手绘视觉符号，一百种可被记住的颜色气候。</p>
                <p>从东方器物到电影光色，沿一根细线徐徐展开。每一件都可停驻、细看与采色。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="atlas-seal" aria-hidden="true"><span>百</span><span>象</span></div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="atlas-main">
        <section class="atlas-controls" aria-label="图鉴筛选">
            <div class="atlas-search-wrap">
                <label for="theme-search">查找符号</label>
                <div class="atlas-search-field">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
                    <input id="theme-search" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="名称、系列或关键词">
                    <kbd>/</kbd>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="atlas-filter-wrap">
                <span class="atlas-filter-label">沿线索引</span>
                <div class="atlas-filters" id="theme-filters" role="group" aria-label="按系列筛选"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="atlas-index-line">
            <p><span id="visible-count">100</span> / 100 SIGNS</p>
            <p id="active-series">全部馆藏</p>
        </div>

        <section class="atlas-gallery" id="theme-gallery" aria-label="视觉主题图鉴"></section>
        <p class="atlas-empty" id="theme-empty" hidden>没有找到相符的视觉符号，换一个关键词试试。</p>
    </main>

    <footer class="atlas-footer">
        <p>THE HANGING ARCHIVE</p>
        <p>颜色不是装饰，而是情绪留下的回声。</p>
        <a href="#top">回到顶部 ↑</a>
    </footer>

    <dialog class="atlas-dialog" id="theme-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-theme-name">
        <div class="dialog-shell">
            <button class="dialog-close" id="dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="关闭详情">×</button>
            <div class="dialog-art" id="dialog-art" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="dialog-copy">
                <p class="dialog-number" id="dialog-theme-number"></p>
                <h2 id="dialog-theme-name"></h2>
                <p class="dialog-en" id="dialog-theme-en"></p>
                <p class="dialog-description" id="dialog-theme-description"></p>
                <div class="dialog-palette" id="dialog-palette" aria-label="主题色值"></div>
                <button class="dialog-apply" id="dialog-apply" type="button" hidden>应用为网站主题</button>
                <p class="dialog-tip">点击任意色值即可复制</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </dialog>

    <div class="atlas-toast" id="atlas-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <noscript><p class="atlas-noscript">需要启用 JavaScript 才能浏览这份图鉴。</p></noscript>
    <script src="/js/visual_themes.js?v=3" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
